<Project>
    <!--
        Rocket.Surgery.LaunchPad.Sdk.WindowsDesktop is Microsoft.NET.Sdk.WindowsDesktop with LaunchPad. A project swaps the one for the other and changes nothing else:

            <Project Sdk="Rocket.Surgery.LaunchPad.Sdk.WindowsDesktop">

        with the version under msbuild-sdks in global.json, or in the attribute (Rocket.Surgery.LaunchPad.Sdk.WindowsDesktop/1.2.3). It is the same as Microsoft.NET.Sdk.WindowsDesktop with
        <Sdk Name="Rocket.Surgery.LaunchPad.Sdk" /> next to it.

        Windows Forms and WPF projects that still name the Windows Desktop SDK, which is obsolete since .NET 5: Microsoft.NET.Sdk
        covers them (UseWPF, UseWindowsForms), and so does Rocket.Surgery.LaunchPad.Sdk. This mirror is for projects that have not moved yet.

        It chains Joinery.Dovetail.Sdk.WindowsDesktop, Dovetail's mirror of Microsoft.NET.Sdk.WindowsDesktop, which imports the Microsoft SDK and then Joinery.Dovetail.Sdk, and then
        applies what every LaunchPad SDK applies (Rocket.Surgery.LaunchPad.Mirror.props). Under a Directory.Build.props that already applies
        Joinery.Dovetail.Sdk or a LaunchPad SDK, neither is applied a second time.
    -->

    <!--
        The versions of the packages the SDK adds and of the Dovetail SDK it chains, generated when the SDK is packed. The version of the
        import wins over a Joinery.Dovetail.Sdk.WindowsDesktop entry in global.json. It is read before the Microsoft SDK imports the Directory.Build.props, so to
        chain another version set LaunchPadDovetailSdkVersion as a global property or an environment variable
        (dotnet build -p:LaunchPadDovetailSdkVersion=1.2.3). Sdk.targets imports the same version, whatever the project sets in between.
    -->
    <Import Project="$(MSBuildThisFileDirectory)Packages.props" />
    <PropertyGroup>
        <_LaunchPadMirrorDovetailSdkVersion>$(LaunchPadDovetailSdkVersion)</_LaunchPadMirrorDovetailSdkVersion>
    </PropertyGroup>
    <Import Project="Sdk.props" Sdk="Joinery.Dovetail.Sdk.WindowsDesktop" Version="$(_LaunchPadMirrorDovetailSdkVersion)" />
    <Import Project="$(MSBuildThisFileDirectory)Rocket.Surgery.LaunchPad.Mirror.props" />
</Project>
